# Generated example docs
apps/*/.leadtype/
# Two output roots because the frameworks differ: Next/Astro/Nuxt generate into
# `public/`, SvelteKit into `static/`. Keep the two lists identical — they
# drifted once already, which left generated feeds, robots.txt, sitemaps, and
# mcp.json untracked-but-not-ignored in the SvelteKit example.
apps/*/public/docs/
apps/*/public/changelog/
apps/*/public/llms-full.txt
apps/*/public/llms.txt
apps/*/public/.well-known/
apps/*/public/feeds/
apps/*/public/mcp.json
apps/*/public/robots.txt
apps/*/public/schema-map.xml
apps/*/public/sitemap.md
apps/*/public/sitemap.xml
apps/*/static/docs/
apps/*/static/changelog/
apps/*/static/llms-full.txt
apps/*/static/llms.txt
apps/*/static/.well-known/
apps/*/static/feeds/
apps/*/static/mcp.json
apps/*/static/robots.txt
apps/*/static/schema-map.xml
apps/*/static/sitemap.md
apps/*/static/sitemap.xml


# Debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Byproducts of driving the example apps in a browser for smoke checks:
# screenshots, captured console output, and accessibility-tree snapshots all
# land at the repo root. None are build inputs or referenced by the docs, so
# they are ignored here rather than committed. Root-anchored on purpose —
# images that belong to an app or to the docs live under those directories.
/*.png
/*.log
/*-snapshot.md

# Misc
.DS_Store
*.pem
.gstack/

# Agent evals
evals/.tarballs/
evals/results/
evals/__agent_eval__/
evals/**/__agent_eval__/
